{"title":"Career roadmap — NGO Program Manager","role":"NGO Program Manager","summary":"An NGO Program Manager designs, implements, monitors and improves social-impact programmes across areas such as education, healthcare, livelihoods, women and child development, rural development, disability inclusion, environment and community development.","facts":{"Current degree":"BA (Bachelor of Arts – General / Honours)","Course":"Sociology"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"flow","items":["The role combines social research","programme management","budgeting","stakeholder coordination","monitoring & evaluation","fundraising/reporting."],"sep":"+"}]},{"heading":"Career horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career focus"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Build sociology, community research, programme management, communication and data skills"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Specialise in development programmes, monitoring & evaluation, CSR, livelihoods, education, health or gender"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progress to Senior Programme Manager, Programme Lead, M&E Lead or Development Consultant"}],[{"text":"2040–2046"},{"text":"Lead large portfolios, multi-state programmes, international development projects or NGO operations"}]]}]},{"heading":"What to build each year","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1 — Sociology & social development foundations"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Sociological theory"},{"text":"Indian society"},{"text":"Social stratification"},{"text":"Gender and society"},{"text":"Rural and urban sociology"},{"text":"Social institutions"},{"text":"Social change"},{"text":"Social problems in India"},{"text":"Community development"},{"text":"Basic economics"},{"text":"Academic writing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Develop:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Communication"},{"text":"Teamwork"},{"text":"Presentation"},{"text":"Field observation"},{"text":"Interview skills"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Output","text":"Conduct a small community study and document the findings."},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2 — Development & programme skills"},{"type":"p","text":"Learn:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Development studies"},{"text":"NGO management"},{"text":"Project planning"},{"text":"Community mobilisation"},{"text":"Participatory research"},{"text":"Survey methodology"},{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Monitoring & evaluation"},{"text":"Basic statistics"},{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"Power BI"},{"text":"Report writing"},{"text":"Proposal writing"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Understand concepts such as:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Theory of Change"},{"text":"Logical Framework"},{"text":"Key Performance Indicators"},{"text":"Outputs vs outcomes"},{"text":"Baseline and endline studies"},{"text":"Impact measurement"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3 — Programme management specialisation"},{"type":"p","text":"Develop capability in:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Programme design"},{"text":"Budget planning"},{"text":"Grant management"},{"text":"Donor reporting"},{"text":"Stakeholder management"},{"text":"Government coordination"},{"text":"CSR programmes"},{"text":"Monitoring & evaluation"},{"text":"Risk management"},{"text":"Impact assessment"},{"text":"Team management"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Choose one development domain:"},{"type":"table","header":["Specialisation","Example programmes"],"rows":[[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"School improvement, digital learning"}],[{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Community health, maternal health"}],[{"text":"Livelihoods"},{"text":"Skill development, employment"}],[{"text":"Women & Gender"},{"text":"Women's empowerment, GBV prevention"}],[{"text":"Child Development"},{"text":"Child protection, nutrition"}],[{"text":"Rural Development"},{"text":"Agriculture, livelihoods, infrastructure"}],[{"text":"Disability Inclusion"},{"text":"Accessibility and employment"}],[{"text":"Environment"},{"text":"Climate, conservation, sustainability"}],[{"text":"Financial Inclusion"},{"text":"Microfinance, financial literacy"}],[{"text":"Youth Development"},{"text":"Employability and entrepreneurship"}]]},{"type":"h","text":"Final-year projects"},{"type":"p","text":"Strong projects could include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Impact assessment of an NGO education programme"},{"text":"Women’s livelihood development programme"},{"text":"Rural employment and skill-development study"},{"text":"Community health awareness intervention"},{"text":"Digital education access in rural communities"},{"text":"Social impact measurement dashboard"},{"text":"NGO programme monitoring system"}]},{"type":"p","text":"A strong final project should include:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Problem","Baseline","Intervention","KPIs","Data","Outcomes","Recommendations"]},{"type":"h","text":"Specialisation options"},{"type":"table","header":["Area","Skills","Potential roles"],"rows":[[{"text":"Programme Management"},{"text":"Planning, execution, budgeting"},{"text":"Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"Monitoring & Evaluation"},{"text":"Indicators, surveys, impact evaluation"},{"text":"M&E Analyst"}],[{"text":"CSR"},{"text":"CSR strategy, reporting, partnerships"},{"text":"CSR Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"Fundraising"},{"text":"Donor relations, proposals"},{"text":"Fundraising Manager"}],[{"text":"Livelihoods"},{"text":"Skill development, rural programmes"},{"text":"Livelihood Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"Education"},{"text":"Education programmes"},{"text":"Education Programme Lead"}],[{"text":"Healthcare"},{"text":"Community health programmes"},{"text":"Health Programme Manager"}],[{"text":"Gender & Inclusion"},{"text":"Gender programmes, inclusion"},{"text":"Gender Programme Specialist"}],[{"text":"Policy"},{"text":"Policy analysis, advocacy"},{"text":"Policy Associate"}],[{"text":"Research"},{"text":"Social research, data"},{"text":"Social Rese