elopment"},{"type":"p","text":"Potential applications:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Beneficiary identification"},{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Programme monitoring"},{"text":"Social-risk prediction"},{"text":"Impact measurement"},{"text":"Translation and multilingual outreach"},{"text":"Automated donor reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human oversight remains essential because social-sector data can involve privacy, vulnerability, bias and sensitive community information."},{"type":"h","text":"4. Climate & Community Resilience"},{"type":"p","text":"Growing areas include:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Climate adaptation"},{"text":"Disaster resilience"},{"text":"Sustainable livelihoods"},{"text":"Water security"},{"text":"Climate migration"},{"text":"Rural resilience"}]},{"type":"h","text":"5. CSR & Social Impact"},{"type":"p","text":"Corporate organisations increasingly need professionals who can connect:"},{"type":"flow","items":["CSR strategy","implementation","measurement","reporting","stakeholder engagement"]},{"type":"note","label":"2040–2046","text":"How the role evolves"},{"type":"p","text":"The NGO Programme Manager will increasingly become a social-impact portfolio manager rather than simply an implementation coordinator."},{"type":"p","text":"Technology will automate parts of:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Data collection"},{"text":"Reporting"},{"text":"Dashboard generation"},{"text":"Documentation"},{"text":"Beneficiary tracking"},{"text":"Monitoring alerts"},{"text":"Grant reporting"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Human leadership will remain critical for:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Community relationships"},{"text":"Ethical decisions"},{"text":"Programme design"},{"text":"Government coordination"},{"text":"Donor relationships"},{"text":"Crisis management"},{"text":"Resource allocation"},{"text":"Organisational strategy"}]},{"type":"flow","items":["The strongest leaders will combine social-sector expertise","management","data","f